// An enter rider on a NON-battlefield destination: riders spell how a
// permanent enters the BATTLEFIELD [CR#614.12] — a card exiled or put into a
// graveyard has no tapped/attacking arrival state, so `Move(This, Exile,
// [Tapped])` is refused with E-POS-RIDER.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Rider On Nonbattlefield Move",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Move(This, Exile, [Tapped])),
  ],
)
